<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; padding: 32px; margin: 0;">
  <table style="max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 32px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <h1 style="color: #111827; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">✅ KYC Approved</h1>
          <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">You're ready to invest!</p>
        </div>

        <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 15px;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
        <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
          Great news! Your KYC documents have been successfully verified by our admin team.
        </p>
        
        <div style="background: #f0f9ff; border: 1px solid #bae6fd; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 16px 0; text-align: center;">
          <p style="color: #0369a1; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Your Client ID</p>
          <p style="color: #111827; font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; font-family: monospace;">{{clientId}}</p>
        </div>

        <p style="color: #374151; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;">
          You can now add funds to your wallet and start exploring investment schemes.
        </p>

        <p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
          <a href="{{dashboardLink}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 36px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 15px;">
            Go to Dashboard
          </a>
        </p>

        <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 24px 0;" />
        <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
          &copy; {{year}} Pennytor. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
